# Redirects for openchatstudio.dimagi.com. Add a rule when a live page moves.
#
# ⚠️ EVERY rule needs BOTH slash forms. Cloudflare serves this file natively and
# matches the source as a literal string, so /foo and /foo/ are two separate
# rules; the form you omit returns 404.

# /platform/ has never been a page — it was a redirect stub in the Django app
# and a meta-refresh stub in the static mirror. It is linked from outside, so it
# keeps forwarding to the home page's How It Works section.
/platform/  /#how-it-works  301
/platform  /#how-it-works  301
